# The names of the encodings of the WHATWG Encoding Standard, in its order,
# and every label that names one: the tables `registry.hero` reads.
#
# Generated, never edited by hand: the Heroes program
# `rebel/generators/unicode_encodings/` read the WHATWG Encoding Standard's
# resources, kept in its folder `whatwg/` as encoding.spec.whatwg.org
# served them on 2026-11-22, as the standard says to read them, packed
# them, held every packed value to the value it read, and wrote this
# module whole; its `check` command says whether this module is still
# what it writes. What it read:
#
# - `encodings.json`, sha256 078212b3697f60b81225b6671bd9da2604497abff0aa8e96e4d46605c02ac9e7

